		"en": [
			"Hizak appeared from \"MOBILE SUIT Z GUNDAM\". -The parts that characterize Hizak, such as backpacks and leg thrusters, have been precisely reproduced. -Soft resin is used for each part power pipe to enhance the texture. ――The head mono eye can be freely attached with a sticker, so you can pursue your own expression. -The mono eye shield is molded into a separate part. Included Armament: Zaku Machine Gun Kai / Optional Shield"
